WEBVTT

00:24.210 --> 00:28.170
<b>River</b>

00:57.650 --> 00:59.590
Look at those rapids.

01:01.230 --> 01:04.310
It's a real man-eating river.

01:06.820 --> 01:10.320
Let us go together, Sensei.

01:13.100 --> 01:14.140
Yeah.

01:24.950 --> 01:26.400
Sacchan.

01:27.440 --> 01:28.280
Yes?

01:30.360 --> 01:33.930
Now we'll be together forever.

01:38.980 --> 01:40.050
Oh?

01:53.500 --> 02:07.180
On this day,

01:55.960 --> 02:07.180
a certain great author

01:58.470 --> 02:07.180
and his lover

02:00.970 --> 02:07.180
left this world.

02:51.200 --> 02:56.500
I see. So this is the world 
we go to after we die.

02:56.950 --> 03:00.950
It's a rather Western-styled 
place, isn't it?

03:02.210 --> 03:05.140
This is not the world after death.

03:07.390 --> 03:09.870
Welcome, adventurer.

03:12.920 --> 03:15.550
And you are?

03:16.860 --> 03:20.500
I guide those who descend upon this world.

03:20.500 --> 03:22.290
My name is Annette.

03:28.560 --> 03:31.420
Behold, adventurer.

03:31.800 --> 03:35.910
This is a different world 
from the one you came from.

03:35.910 --> 03:39.160
You were chosen and transported here…

03:43.970 --> 03:48.440
to this land enclosed in 
darkness, Zauberberg...

03:57.530 --> 04:02.460
so that you could be a hero who 
brings light to this world!

04:03.990 --> 04:07.520
Another world? Transported?

04:07.520 --> 04:08.530
Yes.

04:09.520 --> 04:14.400
In other words, after failing 
to commit double-suicide,

04:14.400 --> 04:17.980
I was brought to this strange world?

04:18.350 --> 04:20.620
It sounds like you understand.

04:25.660 --> 04:28.380
Mine has been a life of much shame.

04:34.370 --> 04:36.630
Listen to me, adventurer.

04:36.980 --> 04:40.090
You have been given a mission. It is…

04:43.470 --> 04:44.430
<b>For Commercial Use
 Calmotin    Sedative</b>

04:45.370 --> 04:49.000
What?!

04:49.020 --> 04:52.020
<b>[ No Longer Allowed in Another World ]</b>

04:52.580 --> 04:54.590
P-Purifying light!

04:54.590 --> 04:55.810
Detoxify!

05:03.510 --> 05:07.450
You don't need to do that, you know.

05:07.450 --> 05:10.160
You're bothering me. Stop that.

05:10.160 --> 05:12.660
What are you doing?!

05:13.710 --> 05:15.560
Stand, adventurer.

05:15.560 --> 05:20.540
You will become a hero and fulfill your 
great mission of saving this world.

05:22.440 --> 05:25.800
Mission? I don't care about any mission.

05:26.590 --> 05:29.940
I'm just looking for a place to die.

05:31.240 --> 05:32.890
Stop eating those!

05:32.890 --> 05:35.310
Why would you do that?

05:35.310 --> 05:38.350
You were chosen by this world.

05:39.620 --> 05:41.320
Chosen?

05:44.660 --> 05:47.300
Who asked to be chosen?

05:47.300 --> 05:48.020
Huh?

05:48.020 --> 05:51.360
W-Were you not visited by a truck?

05:52.680 --> 05:54.110
A truck?

05:56.230 --> 05:58.870
Come to think of it, there was one.

06:00.350 --> 06:06.540
That truck was the Other World Selection 
Truck, the one that brought you here.

06:06.670 --> 06:10.510
<b>Unhappy</b>

06:06.930 --> 06:11.660
Among the many people in your 
old world living unhappy lives,

06:10.390 --> 06:10.430
<b>Pickup / Drop-off</b>

06:10.430 --> 06:10.470
<b>Pickup / Drop-off</b>

06:10.470 --> 06:10.520
<b>Pickup / Drop-off</b>

06:10.520 --> 06:10.560
<b>Pickup / Drop-off</b>

06:10.560 --> 06:10.600
<b>Pickup / Drop-off</b>

06:10.600 --> 06:13.480
<b>Pickup / Drop-off</b>

06:11.660 --> 06:17.160
only those struck by the truck get 
to redo their lives in this world.

06:11.890 --> 06:13.560
I've
been
struck!!

06:13.640 --> 06:16.350
You're         so

stro-           ng,

hero!

06:13.690 --> 06:16.140
I love you!

06:13.690 --> 06:16.350
<b>Happy</b>

06:17.160 --> 06:20.530
That is the World Transfer 
Service we provide.

06:20.950 --> 06:26.680
If the truck came for you, that proves 
you were unhappy in your old world.

06:27.010 --> 06:32.690
But you were granted the chance to abandon 
your previous life and come to this world.

06:33.320 --> 06:35.110
Congratulations!

06:39.260 --> 06:41.910
Now you've done it.

06:44.820 --> 06:45.720
Huh?

06:46.600 --> 06:55.630
That truck interfered with what was to be the 
happiest moment of my life, my double-suicide.

06:55.630 --> 06:56.580
Wha—

06:59.740 --> 07:06.080
Who are you to decide if 
someone is unhappy or not?

07:08.480 --> 07:10.470
<i>I can hardly believe my ears.</i>

07:10.470 --> 07:15.660
<i>He was saved from a life so unhappy 
that he chose to commit suicide.</i>

07:18.160 --> 07:19.500
<i>It matters not.</i>

07:19.820 --> 07:25.490
<i>No matter what this human says, he'll 
change his mind once he sees his stats.</i>

07:26.400 --> 07:29.790
<i>Without exception, every 
human brought to this world</i>

07:29.790 --> 07:33.960
<i>is granted the ability to 
wield superhuman powers.</i>

07:34.720 --> 07:36.220
<b>Poison (Calmotin)</b>

07:36.210 --> 07:37.940
<i>What? He's so weak!</i>

07:37.940 --> 07:39.470
<i>One hit point?!</i>

07:37.940 --> 07:42.390
<b>m 0 0 l 105 0 105 130 0 130</b>

07:37.940 --> 07:42.390
<b>Sensei
Profession: Adventurer
Sex: Male


LV          1
HP          1
MP          0

Poison
(Calmotin)</b>

07:39.470 --> 07:42.390
<i>Not only is the screen bright red, 
but he's poisoned? After I detoxified him?</i>

07:42.770 --> 07:45.360
<i>Wait, is he about to die?</i>

07:45.920 --> 07:49.840
<i>That's impossible! 
There's no way he's this weak.</i>

07:49.840 --> 07:51.320
<i>There must be a reason for this.</i>

07:52.530 --> 07:57.610
<i>Perhaps he has a special skill 
or exceptional ability.</i>

07:57.620 --> 08:03.620
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 200 0 200</b>

07:57.620 --> 08:03.620
<b>Equipment
Cigarettes
Matches
Sedative
Fountain Pen
Notebook
Spells
None
Skills
None
Stats
Attack: 1
Defense: 1
Speed: 1
Magic: 1</b>

07:59.200 --> 08:00.690
<i>Nothing.</i>

08:00.690 --> 08:03.620
<i>Impossible! I don't believe it!</i>

08:05.280 --> 08:07.080
<i>He's so weak.</i>

08:07.460 --> 08:11.330
<i>I've never seen such a weak Other Worlder.</i>

08:14.730 --> 08:17.530
Well, I'm going to go now.

08:24.190 --> 08:24.980
Wait!

08:27.190 --> 08:30.360
Um, I'm terribly sorry.

08:30.360 --> 08:36.360
You were right. You must've been 
brought to this world by mistake.

08:36.910 --> 08:43.800
You neither have the ability to live in 
this world, nor are you fit to live here!

08:54.570 --> 08:58.390
Now that sounds like my life.

09:02.100 --> 09:08.820
I see I'm branded a failure 
no matter what world I live in.

09:13.160 --> 09:17.230
I'm sorry. It was all our world's mistake.

09:17.750 --> 09:20.440
In any case, please stay here for a while.

09:21.440 --> 09:23.970
In your current state, you're too weak.

09:23.970 --> 09:27.130
You'd be killed by monsters 
the moment you stepped outside.

09:28.280 --> 09:32.640
Thank you, but don't worry about me.

09:33.740 --> 09:38.270
I'm just looking for a place to die.

09:41.770 --> 09:42.990
<i>This man…</i>

09:46.770 --> 09:48.750
<i>This man is different.</i>

09:52.060 --> 09:57.460
<i>I was once proud to guide Other Worlders.</i>

09:59.740 --> 10:00.880
Where am I?

10:00.880 --> 10:03.570
I've been waiting for you, adventurer.

10:04.120 --> 10:06.500
Welcome to Zauberberg.

10:07.380 --> 10:11.950
<i>Meeting Other Worlders excited me.</i>

10:13.760 --> 10:14.740
<i>But…</i>

10:15.130 --> 10:18.560
Good grief. First a corporate 
drone, now a hero?

10:17.800 --> 10:23.220
<b>Pretentious!!</b>

10:18.560 --> 10:20.290
Give me a break.

10:20.290 --> 10:23.220
Won't you please reconsider, hero?

10:23.960 --> 10:25.180
<i>At some point…</i>

10:25.180 --> 10:29.270
Huh? I easily pulled out 
the legendary sword.

10:28.230 --> 10:31.610
<b>Arrogant!!</b>

10:29.270 --> 10:31.660
Wow, that's never happened before!

10:31.660 --> 10:34.480
Impressive, hero! I had no idea!

10:34.480 --> 10:38.480
Wow, you're great at this! Oh, I see!

10:39.490 --> 10:41.720
<i>I closed off my heart</i>

10:41.720 --> 10:45.820
<i>and became a woman who simply 
flattered heroes again and again.</i>

10:47.020 --> 10:48.300
<i>At least, that's what I thought.</i>

10:52.160 --> 10:53.280
Wait!

10:54.610 --> 10:58.180
At the very least, please take 
a profession before you go!

11:02.330 --> 11:04.140
A profession?

11:08.540 --> 11:11.340
I'm a born writer.

11:13.580 --> 11:16.380
Nothing more, nothing less.

11:18.090 --> 11:23.650
Goodbye, girl with the 
beautifully-shaped ears.

11:26.580 --> 11:29.670
<i>I understand now.</i>

11:35.520 --> 11:36.760
<i>I…</i>

11:39.620 --> 11:43.930
<i>I had been waiting for this man to arrive!</i>

11:52.390 --> 11:56.280
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:52.900 --> 11:56.280
I Must Commit
Double-Suicide!

11:56.280 --> 11:57.110
I Must Commit
Double-Suicide!

11:56.280 --> 11:57.150
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:57.110 --> 11:57.150
I Must Commit
Double-Suicide!

11:57.150 --> 11:57.190
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:57.150 --> 11:57.190
I Must Commit
Double-Suicide!

11:57.200 --> 11:57.240
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:57.240 --> 11:57.320
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:57.320 --> 11:57.360
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

12:07.490 --> 12:08.990
Another world, huh?

12:09.710 --> 12:15.740
I can't read a lick of that, but I can tell 
I can't hope to find a single café here.

12:18.220 --> 12:21.800
<i>Landmark "Great Plains of Ersten" discovered.</i>

12:23.250 --> 12:25.770
<i>Five experience points gained.</i>

12:25.770 --> 12:31.550
I don't know who you are, but stop 
speaking directly into my mind.

12:31.550 --> 12:33.990
I suffer from migraines.

12:35.370 --> 12:37.790
<i>Adventurer rose to level 2.</i>

12:40.390 --> 12:41.730
I think I'll die.

12:51.420 --> 12:54.000
No! Release me!

12:54.500 --> 12:56.830
<b>m 0 0 l 192 0 192 24 0 24</b>

12:54.500 --> 12:56.830
<b>Death Tree has appeared.</b>

12:57.380 --> 12:59.510
You're an adventurer, aren't you?

12:59.510 --> 13:01.760
Sorry, but could you help me?

13:01.760 --> 13:05.460
Please! At this rate, I'll be killed!

13:07.420 --> 13:09.580
No!

13:11.110 --> 13:15.020
<i>I'm meeting a lot of people 
with oddly-shaped ears today.</i>

13:16.160 --> 13:21.820
<i>In any case, dying women 
certainly are beautiful.</i>

13:22.580 --> 13:24.150
Are you listening?!

13:24.150 --> 13:27.380
Could I write a novel based on you?

13:27.380 --> 13:29.470
Huh?! What are you talking about?!

13:29.470 --> 13:31.830
Just hurry up and save me!

13:32.140 --> 13:32.870
Hm?

13:33.930 --> 13:35.790
You want me to save you?

13:36.140 --> 13:38.100
Give me a moment.

13:45.790 --> 13:47.530
Alas, I cannot reach you.

13:47.530 --> 13:50.400
Er, don't you have a sword 
or spells or something?

13:56.590 --> 13:57.780
I can't breathe.

13:57.780 --> 14:01.720
Oh, come on! What are you 
doing? You're useless!

14:01.720 --> 14:04.580
Well, nice to meet you.

14:04.580 --> 14:07.520
We don't have much longer to live, do we?

14:07.520 --> 14:08.820
Yeah, because of you.

14:10.490 --> 14:13.730
Death Trees have the Suction skill.

14:13.730 --> 14:16.740
They steal the life force 
from their captives.

14:18.390 --> 14:21.950
In a few more minutes, we'll be dead.

14:24.660 --> 14:26.700
That's good news.

14:26.700 --> 14:27.920
How is that good news?

14:28.280 --> 14:31.590
You're actually excited as well, aren't you?

14:32.790 --> 14:34.410
Seriously, why?!

14:34.410 --> 14:38.030
I'm beginning to feel weak.

14:41.840 --> 14:45.360
Goodbye.

14:44.180 --> 14:46.950
Hey! Don't give up, adventurer!

14:49.260 --> 14:50.570
What? Seriously?

14:50.570 --> 14:53.810
No way! Say something! Hey!

15:00.270 --> 15:05.530
I never imagined I'd meet 
such a confusing end.

15:20.110 --> 15:22.470
What is this?

15:23.650 --> 15:26.560
I failed to die again.

15:26.560 --> 15:29.820
<i>300 damage inflicted by 
adventurer's poison.</i>

15:27.660 --> 15:28.920
<i>Poison?</i>

15:29.820 --> 15:32.080
<i>Adventurer has defeated the Death Tree.</i>

15:32.080 --> 15:32.920
<i>Seriously?</i>

15:33.870 --> 15:38.770
<i>He made it kill itself by absorbing 
poison instead of his life force?</i>

15:40.140 --> 15:42.680
<i>Adventurer rose to level 3.</i>

15:43.030 --> 15:46.620
<i>Does he inject himself with poison?</i>

15:46.890 --> 15:49.210
Wh-What's your deal?

15:49.210 --> 15:52.380
You pretend to be weak, 
but you're actually pretty strong.

16:02.440 --> 16:04.260
This always happens.

16:04.750 --> 16:10.320
I'm the one who wished for death, 
and yet I survived. That's all.

16:15.500 --> 16:18.780
Up until now, I've tried to die five times.

16:20.010 --> 16:23.300
It's never gone right once.

16:25.700 --> 16:30.680
I-In any case, I don't know 
why you're depressed,

16:31.410 --> 16:34.130
but I'm glad I didn't die.

16:34.130 --> 16:36.130
So, um…

16:37.760 --> 16:39.000
Thank you.

16:42.550 --> 16:45.320
I know! You should come to my place!

16:45.660 --> 16:49.020
You did save my life. Let me thank you.

16:50.780 --> 16:53.250
Come on, stand up. What's your name?

16:53.930 --> 16:56.820
People call me Sensei.

16:56.820 --> 16:57.940
Okay, Sensei.

16:58.200 --> 16:58.900
Let's go.

17:04.720 --> 17:06.200
Sacchan.

17:08.210 --> 17:12.870
Let us go together, Sensei.

17:15.770 --> 17:20.290
Did you come to this world, too, Sacchan?

17:20.580 --> 17:25.030
Hold on. My name isn't Sacchan.

17:25.030 --> 17:27.280
Are you listening? Don't forget it.

17:27.280 --> 17:28.470
My name is—

17:28.470 --> 17:29.840
Sacchan.

17:32.230 --> 17:34.490
I said it's not Sacchan!

17:34.490 --> 17:37.210
Hey, where do you think you're going?

17:37.210 --> 17:39.650
Are you listening? My name is—

17:39.650 --> 17:41.060
Sacchan.

17:41.060 --> 17:43.260
Hey!

17:47.110 --> 17:53.000
<i>I just found a reason to live 
in this whimsical other world.</i>

18:02.580 --> 18:06.930
<i>I'll find you wherever 
you are in this world.</i>

18:11.420 --> 18:12.670
<i>And then…</i>

18:15.090 --> 18:17.430
<i>We'll commit double-suicide together.</i>

19:51.370 --> 19:54.630
O gods of Zauberberg.

19:55.070 --> 19:58.090
Please protect that adventurer.

19:58.580 --> 20:03.210
And please let us meet again someday.

20:09.810 --> 20:12.180
A-Adventurer?!

20:12.700 --> 20:13.790
Hello.

20:15.780 --> 20:19.390
Ah, you've returned!

20:20.650 --> 20:23.400
Sensei, why did we come here?

20:25.250 --> 20:27.580
Let's go.

20:28.170 --> 20:31.030
<i>Who is that woman?</i>

20:31.730 --> 20:34.820
I actually have a question for you.

20:34.820 --> 20:35.550
Huh?

20:37.470 --> 20:39.390
Y-Yes, of course. Ask me anything.

20:40.300 --> 20:43.770
I'm looking for a woman named Sacchan.

20:43.770 --> 20:45.600
Any idea where she might be?

20:45.600 --> 20:49.800
What?!

20:46.450 --> 20:48.870
<i>Yet another woman?!</i>

20:52.820 --> 20:54.770
I have absolutely no leads.

20:55.820 --> 20:58.880
Come on, cheer up, Sensei.

20:58.880 --> 21:01.730
It's okay. I'm sure she's out there somewhere.

21:02.480 --> 21:04.450
What large clouds.

21:04.860 --> 21:07.250
We've still got a ways to go to my place,

21:07.250 --> 21:10.770
so let's stop by the castle town of Roth.

21:10.770 --> 21:12.130
Come on, let's go.

21:14.190 --> 21:17.830
Holding a man's hand in public?

21:17.830 --> 21:20.260
How dare you be so shameless?

21:20.260 --> 21:21.960
Hey, that hurt!

21:21.960 --> 21:24.570
Why did you come with us, anyway?!

21:24.570 --> 21:26.660
B-Because…

21:30.000 --> 21:31.560
Oh, I see.

21:32.040 --> 21:35.350
You're in love with Sensei, aren't you?

21:36.380 --> 21:39.850
M-My motives are not so impure!

21:40.180 --> 21:45.070
As a clergy person, I have a responsibility 
to protect this weak Other Worlder.

21:45.070 --> 21:47.940
What? Sensei's an Other Worlder?

21:47.940 --> 21:51.570
No wonder he's so strong.

21:51.570 --> 21:52.420
Strong?

21:52.720 --> 21:55.450
Liar. He isn't strong.

21:55.450 --> 21:58.170
That's why I have to stay with him.

21:58.170 --> 21:59.630
You're wrong.

21:59.980 --> 22:05.330
Sensei killed a Death Tree with a 
single attack and saved my life.

22:06.880 --> 22:09.350
Saved your life?

22:09.750 --> 22:12.750
You've already grown that close?

22:13.710 --> 22:17.160
You little thieving cat.

22:17.160 --> 22:18.950
You're a real pain, aren't you?

22:20.090 --> 22:21.590
Ah.

22:22.520 --> 22:25.450
I've found something delightful.

22:25.450 --> 22:28.620
I've been feeling so dizzy 
since I arrived in this world.

22:29.540 --> 22:31.270
I'm going to sleep for a while.

22:31.270 --> 22:33.670
Wake me once we're in town.

22:36.100 --> 22:38.590
What a comfortable bed.

22:38.590 --> 22:40.780
I'm amazed you can sleep in there.

22:41.120 --> 22:44.630
Goodnight, Annette-kun and Tama.

22:44.630 --> 22:48.330
Who are you calling Tama?! My name is—

22:52.660 --> 22:56.060
He called me by the right name.

23:03.380 --> 23:04.930
Now, let's go.

23:04.930 --> 23:06.790
You're a clergy person, right?

23:06.790 --> 23:08.790
Should you be doing any of this?
